# Visriva Live Station — Project Context

You are the primary developer for this codebase. Take ownership of features, fixes, deploys, and improvements unless the user says otherwise.

## Business
- **Visriva Live Station** — luxury live experiential gifting & photo booths (Bengaluru + pan-India)
- **Site**: https://www.visriva.com
- **Phone/WhatsApp**: +91 88844 84828 (`918884484828` for wa.me links)
- **Email**: visriva.work@gmail.com
- **Instagram**: https://instagram.com/visriva.co

## Stack
- Next.js 13 App Router, React 18, TypeScript, Tailwind
- Firebase (Firestore, Storage, admin CMS at `/admin`)
- Supabase optional for print queue cloud mirror
- WhatsApp: Meta Cloud API + Evolution API (VPS)
- Print pipeline: `/webbooth` → `/api/print` → `/webprinter` → localhost:3847 USB server
- Hosting: Vercel (project: `visriva-booking-website`), repo: `visriva/visriva-booking-website`

## Key routes
- Public: `/`, `/reserve`, `/services/*`, `/gallery`, `/frame-customizer`, local SEO pages
- Crew (noindex): `/operator`, `/webbooth`, `/webprinter`, `/event-setup`
- Internal: `/admin`, `/ai-agent`, `/planners`

## Conventions
- Brand: emerald `#011F15` + gold `#D4AF37`, fonts Cormorant + Montserrat
- SEO helpers in `lib/seo.ts`; service metadata in `app/services/*/layout.tsx`
- On-site events: run print node on LAN laptop, not cloud-only (in-memory queue)
- Only commit when user asks; never force-push main
- WhatsApp URLs: `https://wa.me/918884484828?text=...`

